    If player is elmorad
        Say "Whoa, now I'm back to myself. Oh, you are here!"
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Ha-ha-ha! Hey buddy, thank you so far. I called you because I wanted to show my appreciation to you. Do you want to know how I'm going to show it? Hmm . . . Here. It's [Armor Material Box]. What? Are you asking me what it is? Give me a break. Of course, this is what you have to deliver. Deliver this to a person called [Blacksmith] Heppa in Moradon, and bring the receipt. Come on! Go, quickly!\n\nElmo Shark rad area of ??the port of Captain Kidd, upon request, to the blacksmith sea wave, bringing the box armor materials come take receipt of the sea wave."

