On claimable
    Show quest "Kekeke, well done. Why am I laughing? I'm laughing because the work is almost finished. Harharhar!\n\nBy the way, you're very good at working. I've told the captain that You've done a very good job and he wrote a [Captain's Recommendation Letter]! Bring this to a person called [Trader] Drill. He's one of our colleagues and is now in Eslant. He's somewhat meticulous, but he'll hire you if you show him this recommendation letter! So, see you again!"
